  "rules":[
    "Dependencies must be acyclic.",
    "A work unit waits only for declared dependencies and required evidence/capabilities.",
    "Parallel means logically independent work may proceed concurrently; it does not waive point-in-time or source-completeness rules.",
    "Opportunity candidate slates must remain inside frozen U1; no opportunity lane may introduce an unrecalled ticker.",
    "Risk/buyability is a constraint and veto layer, not a bullish opinion that can be outvoted by opportunity lanes.",
    "Every U1 candidate must receive an explicit risk/buyability assessment before final U3 adjudication.",
    "A hard-risk-veto candidate cannot enter the final execution plan.",
    "Advisory and critique outputs do not become the final recommendation without trade_decision_adjudication.",
    "Missing preferred market-data capability degrades or blocks only claims that depend on it; execution assurance must be lowered explicitly.",
    "Post-close nodes may consume the frozen premarket snapshot but may never mutate it.",
    "Post-close grading must separate research recall quality from final-pick activation/outcome/execution-feasibility quality."
  ],
